  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>████ and Light — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to imbue your body and constructs with high speed. You gain resistance to radiant damage and the following:</p>\n<p><strong>Light Beam.</strong> When you make an attack with your Light Construct, you can spend 1 CE to make the attack at advantage and launch the bar, making a ranged spell attack against a creature within 60 ft. When you hit a creature with a melee attack using your Light Construct, you can teleport 10 ft to an unoccupied space you can see as your body becomes a beam of light for a moment.</p>\n<p><strong>Laser Light Techniques.</strong> When you use a Light Technique, you can spend additional CE up to your CE modifier. You deal an additional damage dice per CE spent. This increases to 2 additional dice per CE at 11th level and 3 additional dice at 18th level.</p>",
